{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31052","headline":"怀汾上旧居 · 薛能","name":"怀汾上旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素汾千载傍吾家，常忆衡门对浣纱。\n好事喜逢投宿客，刈田因得自生瓜。\n山头鼓笛阴沈庙，陌上薪蒸突兀车。\n投暗作珠何所用，被人专拟害灵蛇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}